  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Crush those goals one step at a time! Lace up the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 to get into the groove of your daily routine. Durable, versatile, and ready for anything, these sneakers let you go with the flow and swing into action mode. The soft foam and Zoom Air cushioning deliver lightweight comfort for a smooth ride so you can push your limits to the absolute extremes and propel toward your dreams. The durable rubber tread provides enhanced traction, comfort, and support for your feet, no matter how long you‚Äôre on the road. Wherever you want to go, whatever you want to do, the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 has got you covered through it all.</p> <ul> <li>Mesh with TecTuff and utilitarian overlays offers next-level breathability and durability.</li> </ul> <p><strong>*</strong>Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).</p><hr /><p>Long days on your feet call for comfort that does not look overly technical. The Nike Vomero 5 blends breathable layering, supportive cushioning, and retro running style into a versatile everyday sneaker that feels ready for commuting, walking, travel, and light workouts.</p><ul><li>Mesh upper with TecTuff and utilitarian overlays provides breathable durability.</li><li>Soft foam and Zoom Air cushioning deliver lightweight comfort.</li><li>Durable rubber tread adds everyday traction and support.</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say the fit feels true to size and comfortable for all-day wear. For the best fit, we recommend your usual size, with a half-size up worth considering if you are between sizes or prefer a little extra room.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for everyday wear, long hours on your feet, walking, travel, and light gym sessions.</p>  <p><strong>Styling &amp; Versatility</strong></p><p>Inspired by early-2000s running design, the layered upper and sculpted sole give the Vomero 5 a standout look that still pairs easily with joggers, denim, shorts, and other casual staples. It brings sporty energy to your rotation without feeling limited to one lane.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p><p>Many reviewers say the comfort shows up right away, making it easy to wear straight out of the box. For daily use, the mixed-material upper and rubber outsole are widely praised for holding up well through regular rotation.</p>  <p><strong>Care &amp; Maintenance</strong></p><p>To keep the mesh and overlays looking fresh, spot clean with a soft brush or cloth and let them air-dry after wear.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero 5 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Wolf Grey/White/Metallic Silver</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>FJ4151-007</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summa